\\ & =\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}{a \choose k}(a-k) x^k + \sum_{k=0}^{\infty}{a \choose k}k x^{k}
\\ & =\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}{a \choose k}x^k (a-k+k)
\\ & =a \sum_{k=0}^{\infty}{a \choose k}x^k
